## 6. Deployment Strategies — complete

```
## Strategy 1: RollingUpdate (DEFAULT)

Gradual replacement — ek ek pod replace karta hai.
```yaml
spec:
  strategy:
    type: RollingUpdate
    rollingUpdate:
      maxUnavailable: 1
      maxSurge: 1
```
Pros: Zero downtime, traffic hamesha serve hota hai
Cons: Update ke dauraan 2 versions simultaneously run karte hain
  (v1 aur v2 dono) — agar breaking changes hain to issue ho sakta hai

## Strategy 2: Recreate

Pehle SAARE old pods delete karo, phir saare naye pods banao.
```yaml
spec:
  strategy:
    type: Recreate
```
Pros: Kabhi 2 versions simultaneously run nahi karte
Cons: DOWNTIME HOTA HAI (old pods down, new pods start hone tak gap)
Use case: Database migrations jahan old+new simultaneously run karna
  dangerous ho

## Strategy 3: Canary Deployment (Kubernetes native, manual)
Full topic for later, but basic idea:
- 2 Deployments simultaneously: main (90% replicas) + canary (10% replicas)
